# The migration ships by Nov 1
#
# Nodes:  ID : kind : free text
# Edges:  SRC -> DST            (default: supports)
#         SRC -> DST : attacks  (a counter or rebuttal)

C1: claim: The migration will ship by Nov 1.
C2: claim: QA has enough capacity to test the migration.
E1: evidence: The last two migrations shipped on or before their target date.
E2: evidence: The team is fully staffed through the end of October.
E3: evidence: QA ran the full regression suite in two days last quarter.
A1: assumption: The vendor's API does not change again before the freeze.
W1: warrant: Past delivery performance is evidence of future delivery performance.
X1: counter: The vendor is already two weeks late on the current contract.
X2: counter: Two engineers have leave booked in the final week.

W1 -> C1
E1 -> C1
E2 -> C1
A1 -> C1
C2 -> C1
E3 -> C2
X1 -> C1 : attacks
X2 -> C2 : attacks
